      "comment": "Viaghara: Lords of the forest",
      "content": "After Viaghara a succession of lords of the forest ruled the labyrinth, each changing the form of their palace according to their own images and visions. The last one died defending the forest during the cataclysm. Later Rishboland Tigers took up the tiger name, keeping the promise to guard the forest and never harm the Aranara.",
