      "comment": "Viaghara: Faramarz and the Huntress",
      "content": "In weapon and artifact lore, a fallen desert prince named Faramarz tried his luck in the forest after King Deshret's kingdom fell. The lord of the forest, sensing blood on his hands, repeatedly sent a huntress with a white bow (now Hunter's Path) to drive him away. She refused to kill him in hope of redemption, and the king had her lead him into the maze to pick a white branch. His end is unclear, with some accounts saying he died in the forest. The wiki assumes the king was Viaghara; canon does not name him.",
